'''Nero Vipus''' was a [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] of the [[Luna Wolves]] [[Space Marine Legion]] during the [[Great Crusade]].{{Fn|1a}}

==Biography==
During the [[Horus Heresy]], Nero Vipus was a loyal Space Marine of the [[Imperium of Man]], brother-sergeant of [[Locasta Tactical Squad]], 3rd squad of the Luna Wolves [[10th Company (Sons of Horus)|10th Company]] under the command of [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Garviel Loken]]. Loken considered Nero an old and true friend.{{Fn|1a}}

Nero fought in thousands of battle for the Imperium of Man. He fought alongside his Captain in the [[Battle of Sixty-Three Nineteen]], in which he encountered and fought the [[Invisibles]] whilst assaulting the "[[Emperor of Mankind (63-19)|Emperor's]]" palace in the [[High City]].{{Fn|1a}}{{Fn|1b}} Over the course of the fighting, he lost one of his hands.{{Fn|1b}}{{Fn|1c}}

Vipus appeared to perish during the bombardment of [[Isstvan III]], fighting on the side of the loyalist marines under the final command of [[Saul Tarvitz]] of the [[Emperor's Children]] Legion.{{Fn|2}}

