Nerus.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Nerus''' was a former [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter]]'s [[5th Company (Ultramarines)|5th Company]].{{Fn|1b}}
==History==
Under his command, the [[5th Company (Ultramarines)|5th]] was among the [[Ultramarines]]' forces{{Fn|1b}} that were initially sent to aid in [[Ameton Epsilon IV]]'s [[Second Battle of Ameton Epsilon IV|defense]], from a [[Tyranid]] invasion in 853.[[M41]]. [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Maximus Epathus]] served as the overall leader for the [[Chapter]],{{Fn|1a}} but more reinforcements from the Ultramarines had to be sent{{Fn|1c}} before the Tyranids were defeated.{{Fn|1d}} 
==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
*''Nerus'' and [[Ameton Epsilon IV]] were created by the staff of [[Games Workshop]]'s France division. They were featured on an older version of the company's France website.{{Fn|1b}} 

