'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Magos Biologis]] of the [[Mechanicum]] during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]]. A premiere Mechanicum geneticist, Orlandiraz was assigned by [[Malcador (Character)|Malcador]] to aid [[Corax]] in rebuilding his legion after the [[Drop Site Massacre]] with the technology of the [[Primarch Project]]. Orlandriaz journeyed alongside Corax and the [[Raven Guard]] under the Himalazia Mountains to the [[Emperor]]'s abandoned gene-vault, battling through its many traps. Later, Orlandriaz accompanied the Raven Guard back to [[Deliverance]], where alongside [[Apothecary]] [[Vincente Sixx]] he was one of the primary architects of the [[Raptor (Raven Guard)|Raptor]] project.{{Fn|1}}

