Nikolaas Taschen DeHante Corday.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Nikolaas Taschen DeHante Corday'''{{Fn|1b}} was a [[Royal Volpone|Volpone]] [[Colonel]] who served in the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]].{{Fn|1a}}


==Biography==
During the [[Siege of Vervunhive]], Corday was one of [[General]] [[Noches Sturm|Sturm's]] two second officers, alongside Colonel [[Gilbear]].{{Fn|1a}}

Notably, unlike many of the other Volpone senior officers, Corday apparently had a much more amiable relationship with the other [[Imperial Guard Regiment]]s sent to reinforce [[Vervunhive]], in particular the [[Tanith First and Only]]. Although Sturm and Gilbear both openly despised the so called "''[[Ibram Gaunt|Gaunt's]] Ghosts''", Corday actively tried to apologise for the Volpones' actions on [[Voltemand]] that had resulted in many [[Tanith]] casualties and tried to establish a working dialogue with [[Major]] [[Elim Rawne|Rawne]]. Ultimately, however, this was a ruse to try to keep an eye on the Tanith Guardsmen.{{Fn|1b}}

In the final stages of the Siege, Corday's unit was caught in a pincer attack by [[Ferrozoica]]n soldiers. The entire unit was wiped out, Corday dying with his men.{{Fn|1c}}


==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
===Notes===
It is not specified in the source which Royal Volpone regiment Corday was Colonel of. However, there were three such regiments in the Imperial taskforce sent to reinforce [[Vervunhive]] (the [[Royal Volpone 1st|1st]], [[Royal Volpone 2nd|2nd]] and [[Royal Volpone 4th|4th]]), so presumably it is one of these.{{Fn|1a}}


