Nimur Ennat.wikitext:
{{WordBearersPortal}}
'''Nimur Ennat''' was the [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Word Bearers]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]'s [[5th Heavy Assault Company (Word Bearers)|5th Heavy Assault Company]], within the [[Serrated Sun Chapter]].{{Fn|1}} He took part in the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|2}}

==History==
Originally '''Sub-Captain''', Nimur Ennat and his Company were attached to [[Serrated Sun Chapter]] by [[Kor Phaeron]], who wanted to have his eyes and ears within this organisation favoured by [[Lorgar]] himself. Though the [[5th Heavy Assault Company (Word Bearers)|5th Heavy Assault Company]] was a part of the Serrated Sun, however, they were not [[Gal Vorbak]].{{Fn|1}}

During the [[Horus Heresy]]'s [[Drop Site Massacre]], the Captain and his Company were suddenly left isolated by the Gal Vorbak on the [[Urgall Depression]] and they were surrounded by the [[Raven Guard]] who were attempting to break through the [[Word Bearers]]' ranks. Ennat was slain when a squadron of [[Iron Warriors]] [[Typhon Heavy Siege Tank|Typhon tanks]] unleashed a storm of shells on the Raven Guard [[Space Marines]], heedless of the casualties caused amongst their supposed allies.{{Fn|1}}

==Armament==
Nimur Ennat was armed with a [[Proteus (planet)|Proteus-pattern]] [[power sword]] engraved with one of the invocations from [[Erebus]]' and [[Kor Phaeron]]'s new scriptures. This engraving was a sign of Nimur's favour within the [[Word Bearers]]. His other weapon was a [[Phobos-pattern]] [[combi-bolter]] - standard issue to most [[Terminator]] squads of the Word Bearers.{{Fn|1}}

