''Hierophant Technis'' '''Nira Heldentum''' was a loyalist member of the [[Mechanicum]] during the [[Horus Heresy]]. She was the principle [[Imperial]] commander during the [[Defence of Ryza]] and for a time was apparently wounded and captured by the traitors as her broken form was paraded through the streets. However she was able to reappear in the final stages of the battle and organize the final loyalist push that claimed the world.{{Fn|1}}

