Nishome Alvarek.wikitext:
{{CollegiaTitanicaPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Princeps]] of the [[Legio Ignatum]] during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

After the [[Schism of Mars]] Alvarek was among those Princeps that managed to escape to [[Terra]] with their [[Titan]]s. She was subsequently deployed to the [[War Within the Webway]] aboard the [[Warlord Titan]] ''Scion of Vigilant Light''. During the siege of [[Calastar]], Alvarek managed to defeat both a traitor Warlord and [[Warhound Titan|Warhound]] while covering the retreat of her men. The ''Scion'' was badly damaged in the fight, and she was subsequently struck down by the Ignatum [[Reaver Titan]] ''Black Sky'', whose Princeps [[Enkir Morova]] had become possessed by the [[Daemon]] [[Drach'nyen]].{{Fn|1}}

