They became part of the Elucidian Starstriders in exchange for the aid rendered to their squad by [[Elucia Vhane]].{{Fn|2}}

'''Nitsch''' is a strict and professionnal character, who has shown acts of bravery and loyalty toward is squad. '''Stromian Grell''' is the most Veteran of the squad, having served alongside Nitsch on three separate voyages. He keeps his cool in battle by repeating mantras from the Ecclesiarchy. Other squad members include '''Riguez''', '''Shalkus''' who is the deadliest shot with a laspistol, and '''Theolus''' who is the youngest. They are accompanied by the dog '''Aximilion''', whose role is to detect foes hidden by cloaking technology.{{Fn|2}}

