Norand.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Norand''' was a [[Imperial Citizen|citizen]] of [[Vervunhive]] on the [[Imperial]] planet [[Verghast]].{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
Norand was one of the hive's lower classes, who lived in the outhabs beyond the main wall. When Vervunhive was [[Siege of Vervunhive|attacked]] by the [[Ferrozoica]]ns in the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]], Norand was one of many outhab refugees who fled and sought sanctuary within the walls of the inner hive. However, Norand was a lifelong [[obscura]] addict and, deprived of his drugs, began to suffer withdrawal symptoms that resulted in him being committed to a field hospital run by [[Medicae|Surgeon]] [[Ana Curth]].{{Fn|1}}

Although Curth tried to calm him down, Norand lashed out at her and demanded drugs to ease his pain. Things escalated and Norand attacked Curth with a knife that he had smuggled in. Fortunately, Curth's life was saved by [[Tolin Dorden]], a [[Astra Militarum|Guard]] [[medic]] who was assisting Curth's hospital, who was able to restrain Norand and knock him unconscious.{{Fn|1}}

