Noriz.wikitext:
{{ImperialFistsPortal}}
'''Noriz''' was a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Imperial Fists]] [[Space Marine Legion]] during the [[Horus Heresy]] and commander of the [[Strike Cruiser]] ''[[Wrathful Vanguard]]''.{{Fn|1a}}

At the outbreak of the Horus Heresy, Noriz was one of the Imperial Fists assigned to patrol the [[Sol System]] as part of the [[Primarch]] [[Rogal Dorn|Rogal Dorn's]] new security protocols. In the aftermath of the [[Dropsite Massacre]], the [[Raven Guard]] Primarch [[Corvus Corax]] travelled from the [[Isstvan System]] to [[Terra]] to seek an audience with the [[Emperor of Mankind|Emperor]]. When he arrived in the Sol System, Noriz had the ''Wrathful Vanguard'' intercept their [[Battle Barge]], the ''[[Avenger (Battle Barge)|Avenger]]''. After boarding the ship and confirming Corax's survival, Noriz and the Legionaries under his command escorted Corax to Terra.{{Fn|1a}}{{Fn|1b}}

Later, Noriz travelled aboard the ''Wrathful Vanguard'' to the Raven Guard [[Adeptus Astartes Homeworld|homeworld]] [[Deliverance]] in order to deliver the Legion's first shipment of [[Mark VI|Mark VI Power Armour]] — known as '''Corvus Armour'''. When he arrived, he was convinced by the Raven Guard [[Space Marine Commander|Commander]] [[Branne]] to remain with the Raven Guard, rather than returning to garrison Terra.{{Fn|1c}}

Noriz led the Imperial Fists under his command to battle alongside the Raven Guard in numerous battles during the Heresy, including the [[Battle of Ravendelve|defence]] of [[Ravendelve]] on [[Kiavahr]] and the attack on the [[Perfect Fortress]] on [[Narsis]].{{Fn|1d}}{{Fn|1e}}

He was later killed by the [[Adeptus Custodes]] named [[Arcatus]] upon return to [[Terra]] when the Custodes attempted to capture [[Balsar Kurthuri]], a [[Raven Guard]] [[Librarian]] who was travelling on the ''Wrathful Vanguard''. {{Fn|2}}

