Novak Vard.wikitext:
{{AssassinorumPortal}}
'''Novak Vard''' is a [[Vindicare Assassin]], who was ordered to kill [[Ork]] [[Boss]] [[Zagstruck]] in early [[M42]].{{Fn|1a}}
==History==
This occurred after [[Zagstruck]] [[Sarida|defeated]] an invading [[Order of the Ebon Chalice]] strike force, which attempted to reclaim [[St Rezmond's Hope]] from him. When the [[Abbess of the Adepta Sororitas]] heard of their defeat, she petitioned the [[Officio Assassinorum]] to send an assassin to kill Zagstruck. Her request was granted{{Fn|1a}}, as there is a growing concern that Zagstruck will soon launch a [[Waaagh!]] into St Rezmond's Hope's surrounding [[Sector]]. If he did, the [[Imperial]] forces there were stretched too thin to repel Zagstruck and they could not afford the losses to invade St Rezmond's Hope.{{Fn|1b}} Vard was chosen to end Zagstruck's threat to the Imperium, but though he successfully infiltrated the world, no further word was heard from him. After three months of silence, the [[Vindicare Temple]] deployed two dozen [[Servo-Skull]]s into St Rezmond's Hope in order to determine his fate. Their long-range scopes eventually found Vard's bio-signature within Zagstruck's '''Bossfort''', but could not determine his final fate. However without knowing if he was still operational, the Officio Assassinorum is now reluctant to send in further agents into the [[Ork]]-held world.{{Fn|1a}}

