Novastorm.wikitext:
{{TauPortal}}
'''Novastorm''' is a [[Tau Commander|Commander]] from the [[D'yanoi]] [[Sept]], who took part in the [[T'au Empire]]'s [[Fifth Sphere of Expansion]] in [[M42]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}

==History==
He led a [[D'yanoi]] strike force which, along with their [[Vior'la]] allies, sought to add the [[Imperium]] world [[Drevaris]] to the [[Tau Empire]].  The [[Silver Skulls]] and [[Sons of Guilliman]] [[Chapter]]s came to the world's defense, however, and the ensuing battle devastated both sides of the conflict.{{Fn|1}}

Novastorm was later among the [[Tau Empire]]'s forces, that conquered the [[Imperial]] world [[Jovandira]]. It contained a number of relics and, in order to better understand the Imperium, the [[Tau Empire]] began evacuating them for study. Upon learning of this, the Imperium dispatched the [[Strike Force Retribution]] [[Torchbearer Fleet]] to stop the Tau and reclaim the relics. After arriving, the Strike Force struck a city that Novastorm, [[Tau Commander|Commander]] [[Starstrike]] and [[Shas'la]] [[Longstrike]] were overseeing the excavation of six Imperial relics. He would command a smaller force, which would attack where it was needed, while Starstrike commanded the majority of their forces. The ensuing battle devastated both sides and Novastorm was later killed by several [[Imperial Fists]] [[Centurion]]s.{{Fn|2}} 

