'''Noxyn''' was a [[Scout Sergeant]] in the [[Iron Hands]] [[Chapter]]'s [[Clan Dorrvok]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
His squadron of [[Scout]]s was among those sent to [[Ka'saa Clearance|purge]] the [[Ka'saa Debris Cloud]] of [[Xenos]] [[Pirates]], who were attacking [[Imperial]] shipping lanes. This would be another brutal test the members of [[Clan Dorrvok]] had to undergo, as the [[Iron Hands]] are always seeking to purge its ranks of weaknesses; especially so of those who seek to become full [[Battle Brother]]s of the [[Chapter]]. As they deployed into Ka'saa, [[Noxyn]]'s squadron was charged with detonating an operational plasma core within the wrecked [[Imperial]] spaceship, [[Resolute Fire]]. It served as a base for a number of the Pirates and they fought through waves of the Xenos to reach their objective. By the time they did so, however, several Scouts had been killed and the Pirate's resistance had increased to the point that the remaining squadron members had no chance of escaping. With their deaths now certain, Sergeant Noxyn informed his surviving Scouts that they had passed their test to become Battle Brothers and the squadron then ensured that the Resolute Fire suffered a fiery obliteration.{{Fn|1}}

