{{Spoiler|source=Space Marine II}}
Nozick would head a team of [[Tech-Priests]] in the reconstruction of the Aurora device's key or power source. One of Nozick's apprentices was [[Morias Leuze]], a specialist in the [[Immaterium]]. Magos Leuze was the chief [[Artisan]] on Project Aurora.{{Fn|1c}}

Nozick would die in the events of the ''[[Absolver (Thunderhawk)|Absolver's]]'' crash. The Tech-Priest's body would make up a grisly sacrificial display made by the [[Thousand Sons]] or their [[cultists]] who orchestrated the events of the [[Thunderhawk]]'s crash.{{Fn|1b}}

