Nullus.wikitext:
{{AlphaLegionPortal}}
'''Nullus''' was a [[Chaos Space Marine]] of the [[Alpha Legion]], who served as the [[Chaos Lieutenant|Lieutenant]] of the [[Daemon Prince]] [[Kernax Voldorius]].{{Fn|1a}}

Nullus and his warband frequently clashed with the [[White Scars]] [[3rd Brotherhood (White Scars)|3rd Company]] during [[Kor'sarro Khan|Kor'sarro Khan's]] [[Hunt for Voldorius]].{{Fn|1e}} Nullus's force fought against Kor'sarro on [[Sagrifarri]]{{Fn|1e}} and [[Cernis IV]]{{Fn|1a}}; after ambushing the White Scars on Cernis IV, Nullus believed Kor'sarro and his Marines to be dead and returned to Voldorius, who was in the process of conquering the planet [[Quintus]].{{Fn|1b}}

At one point after Voldorius had subjugated Quintus, a team of pro-[[Imperial]] resistance fighters led by [[Makaal]] tried to assassinate the Daemon Prince by sabotaging a [[teleportarium]] array while Voldorius, Nullus and [[Ekit Skarl|Voldorius's equerry]] were travelling through it. Nullus saved his master's life by destroying the malfunctioning device, sealing the [[warp rift]] that it was generating.{{Fn|1c}}{{Fn|1d}}

The White Scars had survived Nullus's trap, however, and tracked him to Quintus. There, the White Scars were able to reinforce a [[Space Marine Company|Company]] of the [[Raven Guard]] led by [[Space Marine Captain|Shadow Captain]] [[Kayvaan Shrike]], in their attempt to liberate Quintus. During the battle, Nullus fought against Kor'sarro and his [[Space Marine Command Squad|Command Squad]], revealing that he was more than just a Chaos Marine - Nullus's form had been enhanced by the power of [[Chaos]]. Nullus claimed to be the embodiment of Kagayaga, a legendary daemon banished by [[Jaghatai Khan]] over ten thousand years ago. This was not enough to best the White Scars, however, and Nullus was killed by the combined efforts of Kor'sarro and the 3rd Company's [[Company Champion|Champion]], [[Kergis]].{{Fn|1e}}

==Wargear==
In battle, Nullus wielded a black-bladed [[power halberd]] that was capable of draining the energy supply of other [[power weapon]]s that it came into contact with.{{Fn|1d}}

