Nytali Hengmuir.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Nytali Hengmuir''' was a [[Chosen of Malcador]] who aided in the [[Imperial Palace]]'s defense, during the [[Horus Heresy]]'s [[Siege of Terra]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
She was among the [[Imperial]]s working within the [[Bhab Bastion]]'s '''Grand Borealis Strategium''', when [[Warmaster]] [[Horus]]' forces reached the [[Inner Palace]], where the Bastion was located. The Strategium served as the main control room for the [[Primarch]] [[Dorn]]'s efforts to plan the [[Imperial Palace]]'s defense and this continued, even when the Bastion was invaded. It was only as the [[Traitor]]s neared the Strategium, that it began to be evacuated for the safety of the Palace's [[Sanctum Imperialis]]. However, this was done too late and Hengmuir was among the many Imperials who were killed within the Strategium, before they could escape.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[The End and the Death: Volume I (Novel)]], 1:xvii 
