Obel.wikitext:
{{TanithPortal}}
'''Obel''' was a [[Guardsman]] of the [[Tanith First and Only]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}


==Biography==
Obel served from the regiment's inception on [[Tanith]], initially as a [[Trooper]].{{Fn|1}}

In the Tanith First's third theatre, [[Caligula (Hive World)|Caligula]], the [[troop-ship]] Obel was riding in was brought down by a [[Psyker|psychic storm]] in [[K7-75|a forest caldera]]. Obel suffered a number of chest wounds, which were bad enough that [[Major]] [[Elim Rawne|Rawne]] advocated leaving Obel and the other wounded behind or mercy-killing them. However [[Colonel-Commissar]] [[Ibram Gaunt|Gaunt]], the regiment's commander, chose to take Obel and the others with them. Sure enough, thanks to Gaunt's leadership, all of the survivors of the crash made it off Caligula in one piece, despite a fight against a number of [[Chaos Cult]]ists.{{Fn|1}}

By the time of the [[Hagia]] campaign, Obel had been elevated to officer status, now holding the rank of [[Corporal]].{{Fn|2}} He was promoted again, to the rank of [[Sergeant (Imperial Guard)|Sergeant]], by the time of the [[Phantine (Planet)|Phantine]] campaign.{{Fn|3}}

