Obelius Mung.wikitext:
{{InquisitionPortal}}
'''Brother {{PAGENAME}}''' was a member of the '''Mung''' family of Eldar Xenos experts{{Fn|1}} and keeper of the [[Vault of Lore]] on [[Terra]]{{Fn|2}}, a descendant of [[Eleusis Mung]].{{Fn|1}} '''Obelius''', along with his mentee [[Ralamine Mung]], was a member of the [[Ordo Xenos]] and spent thirty years studying the [[Eldar]]. Mung translated many Eldar artefacts, including the objects found in the ruins of '''El Daradanel''' on [[Ilium II]] in 9763986.[[M41]],{{Fn|2}} but is great work was translating the '''Seven Scrolls of H'sann''', selections of which were included in Ralamine's [[List_of_known_Imperial_literary_works#T|Translations of Pertinent Eldar Myths]], a collection of Eldar knowledge on the [[Necrons]].{{Fn|1}} 

