Obloxxothrax.wikitext:
{{NurglePortal}}
'''Obloxxothrax''' is a [[Great Unclean One]] of [[Nurgle]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
In [[M42]], the [[Greater Daemon]] spread the [[Retchpox]] on the [[Imperial]] [[Feudal World]] [[Malaeor]]. From a single victim, the disease began to spread dramatically across the backwater province of '''Piety's Promise''', despite the world's medical corps knowing how to cure it. This was due to the Malaeor's ruling elite refusing to give their serfs access to modern technology, which in turn caused them to view its usage as being the sole domain of the [[God-Emperor]]. They fiercely resisted the treatment because of this and their village [[priest]]s fed the flames by promising healing through flagellation and prayer. Matters further escalated when several victims of the disease that were under the care of a [[priest]] named '''Frater''' [[Kalimund]], recovered without receiving any of the medics' aid. He claimed the plague was a test of faith and preached that the world's population should turn away from the false promises of [[heretic]] healers and barons, and instead make the pilgrimage to Kalimund's shrine in '''Promulga Valley'''. The Frater planned to cure all who attended, but on the day this was to occur, he suddenly erupted in front of his congregation while on the seventh verse and seventh lines of his oration. From Kalimund's remains rose Obloxxothrax who gave his own blessing that caused the Retchpox's victims within the Valley to be devoured by the disease.{{Fn|1}} 

This turned their remains into liquid corpse-slop, which turned the region into a lake of filth. The [[Mordian Iron Guard|98th Mordian Iron Guard]] later arrived there, after having been sent by Malaeor's [[Imperial Commander]] to stop Frater Kalimund and his followers, but the [[Regiment]] saw nothing but the liquid, which began to sicken them. Obloxxothrax would then emerge from it, at the head of an army of [[Nurgle]]'s [[Daemon]]s and they easily overran the Mordians. From there, the Great Unclean One led his host across Malaeor and the world began to be infected and changed by the [[Chaos God]]'s might. While the [[Imperium]]'s forces on Malaeor fought back as best they could, this was not a war that could be won with their weapons. By the time the world's distress calls were answered by a [[Salamanders]] strike force and the [[Inquisitors]] of the [[Ordo Malleus]], it seemed they could do little to save Malaeor. Yet still they joined the fight, for just as a single [[Retchpox]] sufferer had begun this pestilent nightmare, so to could Malaeor not be allowed to be but the first of many worlds to suffer Obloxxothrax's plague.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Codex: Chaos Daemons (9th Edition)]], pg. 23 - ''War Zone: Malaeor''

