Obsidian Knight.wikitext:
{{ImperialKnightsPortal}}
[[Image:ObsidianKnight.jpg|thumb|right|The {{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|2}}]]
The '''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an [[Imperial]] [[Freeblade Knight]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}

Little is known about the Freeblade that some of the [[Astra Militarum]] call the Obsidian Knight. The first recorded sighting came during the [[Damocles Gulf Crusade]] over two hundred years ago. Out of nowhere strode the dark behemoth, covered in fell symbols. He single-handedly halted a [[Tau]] river crossing, and appeared in dozens of battles. The Knight disappeared by campaign’s end, remembered only in legend. Two centuries later, when the Tau general [[Commander Shadowsun]] launched her invasion of [[Agrellan]], the Obsidian Knight appeared once again. Whether or not it was the same [[Knight]] is unknown, but it fought with the same zeal, leaving behind a wake of crushed and blasted Tau. Although the [[Xenos]] eventually triumphed on Agrellan, the Obsidian Knight has since been sighted elsewhere, fighting alongside the Imperium.{{Fn|2}}

