Occam.wikitext:
{{AlphaLegionPortal}}
[[Image:OccamArt.jpg|thumb|right|220px|Occam the Untrue{{Fn|1a}}]]
'''Occam''', known as '''Occam the Untrue''', is the leader of [[The Redacted]], an [[Alpha Legion]] warband. He still sees himself as loyal to the [[Emperor]] and sees his warband as a test for weakness in the followers of the [[Imperium]].{{Fn|1a}}

Sometime after the opening of the [[Great Rift]], Occam and his warband were waging war on [[Ultramarines]] successors in the [[Maelstrom Zone]] under the general authority of [[Harrowmaster]] [[Quetzel Carthach]] and his [[Sons of the Hydra]].{{Fn|1a}} They were tasked by a [[Necron]] [[Cryptek]] to find a [[Tesseract Labyrinth]] in exchange for the location of [[Omegon]]. Occam agrees and his small warband goes to the [[Maelstrom]], stealing the Tesseract from the [[Word Bearers]]. However the object inside the Tesseract is unleashed and revealed to be the [[Bloodthirster]] [[Kar'Nash'gahar]] who escapes. Later, Occam and his warband travels to the [[Galactic Core]] where they discover more Alpha Legion forces building [[Necron Pylon|Pylons]] under the command of Omegon.{{Fn|1b}}

However, the Cryptek reveals that this "Omegon" is in fact a [[C'tan Shard|shard]] of [[The Deceiver]], and a vicious battle erupts that sees only Occam and his warband survive before the shard is trapped in the now-empty Tesseract labyrinth. Occam kills the Cryptek before leaving.{{Fn|1c}}

