'''Octavius''' is a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] in the [[Legion of the Damned]], who was once a member of the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter]]'s [[First Company (Ultramarines)|First Company]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He died defending the [[Ultramarines]]' domain of [[Ultramar]] and was entered into the annals of the [[Chapter]]'s heroes. However this was not the end of Octavius' service to the Ultramarines. Since his death, the Chapter's forces have reported encounters with a group of unknown [[Space Marines]], who suddenly appear and aid the Ultramarines, when they are in dire straits. This group disappears afterwards and is unidentifiable, except that their leader bears a holy relic of a lost Ultramarine. This is in fact Octavius, who somehow became a member of the [[Legion of the Damned]] after his death and is now a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] in its ranks. He later took part{{Fn|1}} in the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s{{Fn|2}} [[Mont'shi Campaign]], which was launched against the invading [[T'au Empire]].{{Fn|3}} While the Campaign eventually ended in failure,{{Fn|2}} Octavius survived the Crusade.{{Fn|1}}
