Oldorian Mefistal.wikitext:
{{AdeptusCustodesPortal}}
'''Oldorian Mefistal''' is a member of the [[Adeptus Custodes]]' [[Dread Host]] and is among its forces currently stationed aboard the [[Moiraides]] warship ''[[Aetropas]]''.{{Fn|1}}

==History==
They were fighting the [[World Eaters]] near the [[Eye of Terror]], when the ''Aetropas's'' forces learned of the [[Battle of Lion's Gate]]. The news caused them to rage, both at being unable to stop the attack on [[Terra]] and for not being there to aid in its defence. This led Mefistal to declare that their Dread Host would now never rest from battle. His fellow [[Custodian]] [[Konstans Pulkyria Herakloni]] and the others agreed with him and so began their war of vengeance against the [[Imperium]]'s foes.{{Fn|1}}

So far they have defeated the [[Black Legion]] on [[Dakhorth]], destroyed the [[Shattered Bone]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]], banished the [[Daemon]] hordes of [[Drch'yyne'kyl]] on [[Klythes IV]] and purged the [[Orks]] from [[Lenthis]], with the aid of the [[Sisters of Silence]]. Their most recent battle led to the destruction of the [[Dark Eldar]] on [[Bajil]], which freed the [[Xenos]]' tortured prisoners.{{Fn|1}}

