Olin Fencer.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Olin Fencer''' was a [[Captain (Imperial Guard)|Captain]] of the [[Vervun Primary]], the [[PDF|standing army]] of [[Vervunhive]] on the planet [[Verghast]].{{Fn|1a}}


==Biography==
Fencer and his men were stationed outside Vervunhive's walls at '''Outhab Southwest''' when the [[Lost and the Damned|corrupted army]] of [[Ferrozoica]] [[Siege of Vervunhive|attacked Vervunhive]]. His unit of 50 men, unprepared for an attack, took heavy casualties in the initial waves of artillery bombardments and were unable to communicate with Vervun command as their [[Vox|vox-links]] had been destroyed. Lacking orders, Fencer followed emergency protocol and, even as the shelling continued, he and his surviving men started erecting defences - trenches, mines and barricades - to slow down the attacking Zoicans. They also received unexpected reinforcements in the form of outhabbers who had survived the bombardment; Fencer had every able-bodied man and woman his unit encountered [[Conscript|pressed into service]] and ready to stand against the Zoicans.{{Fn|1a}}

When the Zoicans led their first attack on the hive, Fencer and the men and women under him managed to kill an impressive number of Zoican soldiers, including the destruction of at least four tanks. Unfortunately, there were simply too many and, despite holding their position against the enemy for hours, Fencer's unit was slowly ground down. Most of the Vervun were killed with Fencer himself shot by a Zoican [[Lasgun|las-round]].{{Fn|1a}} The survivors eventually [[Scratch Company|regrouped]] under one of the conscripts - the miner [[Gol Kolea]].{{Fn|1a}}{{Fn|1b}}

