{{DrukhariPortal}}
'''Onskellis''' is a [[Drukhari]] [[Archon]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was among the [[Drukhari]] forces{{Fn|1}} that invaded the [[Chinchare sub-sector]], in the wake of the [[13th Black Crusade]]. However the [[Imperium]] later launched the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Kith Campaign]], against the [[Xenos]] and Onskellis would become one of its priority targets.{{Fn|2}} During the Campaign, he led raids against Imperial worlds and these attacks left no survivors. Pict footage taken from these raids have observed that the [[Archon]] preferred close combat and displayed heightened frenzy for periods of time. Onskellis was also seen riding a [[Daemonic]] entity, which was similar to the Daemons seen fighting beside the [[Thousand Sons]] [[Traitor Legion]]. The Imperium later came to believe its forces killed the Archon during one of the Campaign's battles, but this has not been confirmed.{{Fn|1}} 
