Onti Flyte.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
{{spoiler|source=The Guns of Tanith (Novel)}}
'''Onti Flyte''' was an [[Imperial citizen]] who lived in the city of [[Cirenholm]] on the planet [[Phantine (Planet)|Phantine]].{{Fn|1a}}


==Biography==
Prior to the [[Blood Pact]] invasion of Phantine, Onti was a wife and a mother of three. However, when the Blood Pact captured Cirenholm, her husband was killed by the [[Chaos]] soldiers and Onti and her children were imprisoned with most of Cirenholm's citizens in the city's tertiary dome.{{Fn|1a}}

When the [[Imperial]] forces of the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]] arrived to retake Phantine, they successfully liberated Cirenholm and freed the Blood Pact's captives.{{Fn|1a}} Flyte returned to her home but was unable to enjoy her freedom for very long, as she was murdered by [[Lijah Cuu]], a psychopathic [[Guardsman|Imperial Guardsman]] who had been looting her home in the aftermath of the battle.{{Fn|1a}}{{Fn|1b}}

