Orad.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Orad''' was the [[Chaplain]] of the [[Ultramarines]] [[2nd Company (Ultramarines)|2nd Company]], under [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Cato Sicarius]].  He fought with the 2nd Company during the [[Assault on Black Reach]]{{Fn|1}}, but died on [[Karthax]] forty-three years later, in combat with [[daemon]]ic forces.{{Fn|2}}{{citethis}}

The exact circumstances of Orad's death were kept secret for a long time, even from the majority of the Company; Orad had been possessed by a [[daemon]] of [[Nurgle]] and killed several of his battle brothers, before being shot down by [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Vorolanus]].  For decades afterward, Vorolanus was shaken by the Chaplain's death - he had never thought that someone of Orad's rectitude could ever succumb to possession - and his own role in it.{{Fn|2}}{{citethis}}

