Oresk Torgoll.wikitext:
{{KhornePortal}}{{WorldEatersPortal}}{{IronHandsPortal}}
{{Clear}}
'''Oresk Torgoll the Reaper''' is a [[World Eaters]] [[Chaos Lord]], who was once a member of the [[Iron Hands]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
His downfall began during the [[Horus Heresy|Heresy]]'s [[Dropsite Massacre]], when Torgoll was captured by the [[World Eaters]] and thrown into their fighting pits. He was also given the [[Butcher's Nails]] and all this caused Torgoll to hate his [[Primarch]], [[Ferrus Manus]], and the [[Iron Hands]] for abandoning him to the [[Traitor Legion]]. Eventually he accepted his fate and challenged and slew the commander of the World Eaters' [[201st Mobile Artillery Company]]. The Traitor Legion cheered him on for this and since then, Torgoll's sieges have killed an unknown number of billions and have become things of legend. The Chaos Lord's reputation was sealed though, when he destroyed a hundred of the [[Death Korps of Krieg]]'s [[Regiments]] on [[Enthadia III]]. Despite all this, however, Torgoll's feelings for his Primarch and the Iron Hands have not changed. His hatred for them outshines the levels of hate, that many World Eaters are capable of.{{Fn|1}}

