Orhu Gythua.wikitext:
{{DeathGuardPortal}}

{{PAGENAME}} was a Legionary in the [[Death Guard]].{{fn|1a}}

==Biography==
{{Spoiler|source=The Outcast Dead (Novel)}}
Gythua was one of the Astartes assigned to the [[Crusader Host]] when the [[Horus Heresy]] broke out. At that point, [[Rogal Dorn]] ordered the Host be captured, and Yasu Nagasena led a force of 3,000 men to that aim, resulting in the surviving Astartes' imprisonment in [[Khangba Marwu]].{{fn|1b}}

He was one of those who escaped from the prison, and had formed a close friendship with [[Argentus Kiron]] of the [[Emperor's Children]]. A hulking figure even for an Astartes, his fellow warriors had dubbed him "Goliath".{{fn|1b}}

He was grievously impaled by debris when the cargo aircraft stolen by the [[Outcast Dead]] crashed, but did not die until their battle against [[Babu Dhakal]]'s men, when he intimidated [[Ghota]] out of crushing Kiron's skull before dying next to his friend.{{fn|1d}}

