'''Ori'priam''' is a [[Water Caste]] emissary in the [[T'au Empire]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was among{{Fn|1}} its forces that invaded the [[Imperial]] [[Sector]]s near the [[Damocles Gulf]], in the wake of the [[13th Black Crusade]].{{Fn|2}} The invasion was part of the [[T'au Empire]]'s [[Third Sphere of Expansion]],{{Fn|3}} which was led by the [[Ethereal]] [[Mont'shi]]. However the Imperium would later launch the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Mont'shi Campaign]] against the invading [[Xenos]].{{Fn|2}} During the Campaign, Ori'priam brought word to Mont'shi that their invasion of the Imperial world [[Draven III]] had entered a stalemate and that additional Imperial forces were being sent there. The Ethereal would give Ori'priam orders to deliver to [[Tau Commander|Commander]] [[Eirl'O'Vash]] to counter this and then asked if the [[Tau Pathfinder|scouts]] he had sent to find a structure in the [[Vendrea System]] had returned. The Emissary replied that they had and that the scouts had located the structure on the [[Moon]] of the System's third world. The Ethereal would then order Ori'priam to secure the structure's location from the Imperium's reach at once, as it was important to the T'au's future.{{Fn|1}} Sometime later, the Mont'shi Campaign's Imperial forces were defeated by the T'au Empire.{{Fn|2}} 

