Orin Helmawr.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
'''Orin Helmawr''' (born '''970.[[M41]]''') is the 12th recognized son of [[Gerontius Helmawr]], the [[Imperial Commander|137th Lord]] of [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]].{{Fn|1d}}

==History==
In [[M42]], the [[Great Rift]]'s [[Noctis Aeterna]] struck the [[Hive World]] and in the mayhem that followed, an [[Assassin]]'s attack left [[Gerontius Helmawr|Gerontius]] in a [[Stasis Casket]]. With their Father now unable to rule [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]], a power struggle broke out between Gerontius' heirs to replace him as its [[Imperial Commander]].{{Fn|1a}} The [[Lady Credo]], though, used the opportunity to launch a world-wide rebellion to end [[House Helmawr]]'s rule of the Hive World.{{Fn|1b}}

In the mayhem that followed, many of Gerontius' heirs were killed by various forces. However, his daughter [[Haera Helmawr]] became the [[Imperial House]]'s de facto ruler{{Fn|1d}}, after she asked her surviving siblings to attend a family meeting and then killed them all.{{Fn|1c}} Orin and six other heirs were not there though, and they are now likely hiding to avoid their cruel Sister's grasp.{{Fn|1d}}

