Ormand.wikitext:
{{DarkAngelsPortal}}
'''Ormand''' was a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Dark Angels]] during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
Subordinate to [[Chapter Master]] [[Althalos]], who commanded the [[Star Fort]] ''[[Chimaera]]'', 59 years before the Heresy Ormand and his forces were dispatched to conquer worlds and establish outposts by [[Luther]]. Ormand and his forces were completely unaware of the eruption of the Horus Heresy or Luther's corruption on [[Caliban]].{{Fn|1}}

During the [[Battle of the Alaxxes Nebula]], Ormand boarded the [[Space Wolves]] flagship ''[[Hrafnkel]]'' to determine if the Wolves were still loyal to [[Emperor of Mankind|the Emperor]]. However he was shortly after captured by the [[Rune Priest]] [[Kva]], who sensed his duplicity. Brought on the bridge of the flagship and seeing the Wolves battle the treacherous [[Alpha Legion]], Ormand determined the Wolves' loyalty and the Dark Angels [[Star Fort]] ''Chimaera'' arrived to win the day. Afterwards, Ormand and Althalos were informed on the chaos throughout the [[Imperium]] by [[Leman Russ (Primarch)|Leman Russ]] and decided to return to Caliban.{{Fn|1}}

