'''Oryith Ironeye''' was the [[Squat Lord]] of the [[Leagues of Votann]]'s [[Confederation of Urlish]] [[League (Votann)|League]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
In the aftermath of the [[Horus Heresy]], she was informed by the [[Norgyr League]] of a unique opportunity that had emerged on [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]. The [[Hive World]] needed to be rebuilt following the [[Imperium]]'s civil war and Ironeye saw the potential of how this would benefit the [[Confederation of Urlish]]. The [[Squat Lord]] then led thirteen of the [[League (Votann)|League]]'s [[Bastion Vessel]]s to Necromunda, where she struck a deal with the Hive World's rulers. In exchange for aiding in rebuilding their [[Homeworld]], the Confederation would be granted the permanent mining rights to Necromunda. In time, this agreement led to the formation of the Hive World's [[Ironhead Squat Prospector]] clans, who the people of Necromunda named after Ironeye.{{Fn|1}}  

