Osmyndri Ellisentris Kallistus.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Osmyndri Ellisentris Kallistus''' was the ruling [[Imperial]] [[Planetary Governor|Governor]] of the [[Mining World]] [[Ghyre]] at the dawn of the [[Age of the Dark Imperium]], also serving as Clan Lord of [[Prime Clan Kallistus]], [[Spire Lord]] of [[Hive Angelicus]] and [[Air Marshal|Supreme Air Marshal]] of Ghyre.{{Fn|1a}}


==Biography==
In her youth, Governor Kallistus was famous as an ace [[Lightning]] pilot; even after ascending to the throne of Ghyre she continued to wear the uniform of an Air Marshal and was said to have never allowed her piloting skills to degrade over the years.{{Fn|1a}}

Following the formation of the [[Great Rift]], Ghyre suffered a period of civil instability that coincided with the obscuration of the [[Astronomican]] by the [[Warp Storm]] along with [[Chaos|malign phenomena]] and increased populations and activity of various Ghyrish predatory beasts. Even after contact was reestablished with the wider Imperium, Ghyrish officials failed to supress the growing number of insurgent actions across the planet. After seeking advice from [[Space Marine Sergeant|Brother-Sergeant]] [[Torgan]] of the [[Imperial Fists]] [[Chapter]] (who led a [[Space Marine Honour Guard Squad]] assigned to watch over Ghyre), she decided to send a request for aid to the Fists directly despite the risk such an action posed to Ghyre's [[astropath]]s.{{Fn|1a}} It later transpired that a [[Genestealer Cult]] called the [[Cult of the Wrything Wyrm]] had been formed and this was the source of the insurrection.{{Fn|1b}}

