Ostromandeus.wikitext:
{{OrdoHereticusPortal}}
[[Image:OstromandeusRetinue.jpg|thumb|right|210px|Ostromandeus and his retinue{{Fn|1}}]]
'''Ostromandeus''' is a mysterious [[Psychic]] [[Ordo Hereticus]] [[Inquisitor]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
An uncompromising servant of the [[Emperor]],{{Fn|1}} Ostromandeus is relentless in his [[Ordo Hereticus|duties]] and [[Crusade|crusades]] to purge the [[Galaxy]] of [[Heretics]]. He hunts down [[heresy]] with unyielding fury and no [[Traitor]] can escape the [[Inquisitor]]'s wrath. Ostromandeus is even willing to [[Exterminatus|burn entire worlds]] to ensure this does not occur.{{Fn|2}}

Ostromandeus is notable for his persecution of [[Chaos Cultist|cultists]] on the planet [[Caldassa]]. He and his [[Inquisitorial Retinue|retinue]] quietly made planetfall and seized control of Caldassa's [[vox]]-fortress. After wiring his vox-[[servitor]], [[Stentor-I-52]], into the fortress's systems, he instructed the servitor to broadcast a continual series of bombastic orations, which were then blasted through the vox-networks of every one of the planet's [[hive]]s. The heretics' morale was broken. By the time [[Imperial]] forces arrived to secure Caldassa, many on both sides had been driven mad by the ceaseless castigations; nevertheless Caldassa was returned to the Imperial fold.{{Fn|3}}

==Assets==
He wears a custom suit of armor, alongside a [[Force Sword]] and an [[Inferno Pistol]]. The Inquisitor is also accompanied by a [[Vox Skull]] and the bizarre [[Stentor-I-52]], who can unleash deafening tirades of bombastic oration.{{Fn|1}}

