Ozostium Aranthus.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
'''Ozostium Aranthus''', the '''First of Aranthus''', the '''Divine Prince''', is a [[psychic]] member of [[House Aranthus]] of [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]], whose appearance is that of a giant [[human]] clad in metal armour.{{Fn|1a}}

==Biography==
[[Image:OzostiumAranthus1.jpg|thumb|right|250px|{{PAGENAME}} miniature{{Fn|2}}]]
===Fallen House===
It was long believed that [[House Aranthus|Aranthus]] was a [[Fallen House]], but Ozostium and his siblings were alive and imprisoned by the ruling [[House Helmawr]], who were among the House's enemies.{{Fn|1a}}

Ozostium had been placed in a casket that resided within the vaults of the [[Cathedral of the Emperor Deified]] in [[Hive Temenos]].{{Fn|1a}} He was able to use his [[Psychic]] powers to influence the minds of others and began plotting to free himself.{{Fn|1b}} When he would be free, Ozostium would then free his siblings and lead a reborn House Aranthus to destroy Helmawr's bloodline and claim [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]] for himself.{{Fn|1a}}

===The Credo Rebellion===
Centuries later, Ozostium gathered servants such as [[Lady Credo]] and the [[Prophet of Redemption]] to his cause, along with other powerful allies and armies hidden from Helmawr's gaze. After the [[Great Rift]] opened, [[Noctis Aeterna|darkness enveloped]] Necromunda and Ozostium knew that it was time to set his plans into motion and called upon his servants to carry them out.{{Fn|1b}}

Due in large part to the actions of Lady Credo and the Prophet of Redemption, Ozostium was freed from Temenos's vaults and immediately took over the hive and used it as his base of operations. He then turned his attention to conquering the rest of the [[Palatine Cluster]], as Ozostium's hidden agents and armies rose up to weaken House Helmawr's grip on [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]].{{Fn|1b}}

Lady Credo also assured Ozostium that his agents were scouring the [[Hive World]] to find and free his imprisoned siblings. However, the acting [[planetary governor]], [[Haera Helmawr]], still fought to keep her rulership of Necromunda.{{Fn|1b}}

