Palaemon.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinesPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Contemptor Pattern Dreadnought]] '''Hecaton''' of the [[Minotaurs]], considered a hero to his [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
[[Image:Hecaton_Palaemon.jpg|thumb|right|250px|Hecaton Palaemon]]
Before his internment, Palaemon fought in the [[Macharian Heresy]], where he was poisoned on the [[Ocean World]] [[Nereus]] while pursuing the extermination of the [[xenos]]-possessed Fourth Company of the [[Imperial Paladins]] Chapter. Despite the xenos poisons ravaging his body, Palaemon went on to fight for three whole days before finally succumbing to their effects. This mighty deed served as an example to his [[Battle Brother]]s and earned his place amongst the Minotaurs' revered [[Space Marine Dreadnought|Dreadnoughts]].{{Fn|1}}

After his internment, Palaemon was part of the cadre of Dreadnoughts permanently stationed on the ''[[Daedelos Krata]]''. He took part in the [[Orphean War]], launched via [[boarding torpedo]] at the [[Necron]] [[Tomb Ship]] ''[[Dead Hand]]'', during the [[Orphean War#The Battle of Amarah|Amarah Void Battle]].{{Fn|2}} His final fate remains unknown, but he was presumed to have fallen in glory.{{Fn|1}}

Palaemon was equipped with a [[Dreadnought Close Combat Weapon|Power Claw]] and [[Multi-Melta]] at the time of his disappearance and presumed death.{{Fn|1}}

