Pale One.wikitext:
{{SlaaneshPortal}}
The '''Pale One''' is an exiled [[Keeper of Secrets]], who rulers over an impoverished realm in the [[Warp]] known as the [[Halls of the Wilfully and Ecstatically Blind]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
It lies far from where [[Slaanesh]] dwells in the grand court of the [[Palace of Slaanesh|Palace of Pleasure]], but even there ambition burns in the hearts of all of the [[Chaos God]]'s children. Because of this, the Pale One and the Hall's other Daemons make war upon each other with lies, poison, temptation, and a thousand other treacheries. The Daemon [[Varak'suul]] briefly served in the Pale One's entourage as a courtier, before she soon fled the Halls' Daemons to hide within the far reaches of the [[Warp]].{{Fn|1}}

