Pallas was present during the Chapter's assault on the [[Van Skorvold Star Fort]], serving under [[Space Marine Commander|Commander]] [[Caeon]].  When [[Caeon]] was stabbed and poisoned by [[Veritas Van Skorvold]], Pallas was one of the [[Space Marines|Marines]] responsible for ministering last rites to Caeon, alongside [[Chaplain]] [[Iktinos]] and Caeon's former [[equerry]], [[Michairas]].{{Fn|1a}}{{Fn|1b}}

Pallas then proceeded to serve under [[Librarian]] [[Sarpedon]], becoming one of those [[Space Marines]] who followed Sarpedon in [[Renegade Chapter|rebelling]] against the [[Imperium]].{{Fn|1c}}{{Fn|2}}

Following the Soul Drinkers attack on [[Magos|Archmagos]] [[Khobotov|Khobotov's]] [[Geryon Ordinatus]] platform, he rescued the wounded [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Tellos]] and spent the next few months tending to his recovery.{{Fn|1c}}{{Fn|1d}}

