Pallid Prince.wikitext:
{{ChaosPortal}}
The '''Pallid Prince''' was a [[Daemon Prince]] of [[Chaos]].{{Fn|1}}

In 976.[[M35]] he created a [[Warp Storm]] that descended on the [[Rorn System]].  A squad of [[Grey Knights]] destroyed the Pallid Prince and his [[Warp]]-iron vessel, but were trapped by the storm on the [[Rorn Primarex]] shipyard.  Unwilling to risk discovery by the citizens of [[Rorn III]], and denied Warp travel by the storm, the Grey Knights set out into the void at sub-light speeds, the battle-brothers entering stasis for their millennia-long voyage back to [[Titan (Moon)|Titan]].{{Fn|1}}

