Paramyx.wikitext:
{{NurglePortal}}
'''Paramyx''' is the [[Plague Lord]] of the [[Blighted Claw]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]].{{Fn|2}}
==History==
He was once the [[Chapter Master]] of the '''Sanctors of Terra'''{{Fn|2}}, before they were deemed corrupted by the powerful [[Saint Basillius]]. The Sanctors and twenty-nine other [[Chapter]]s were given the choice to take part in a [[Crusade]] within the [[Eye of Terror]] or to be destroyed. Choosing to redeem his Chapter, Paramyx led the Sanctors into the Eye, in what would become known as the [[Abyssal Crusade]]. There disaster would strike all the Chapters involved, with many becoming corrupted into the servants of Chaos. Paramyx and the Sanctors were no different and when they emerged from the Eye, they were reborn as the [[Blighted Claw]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]]{{Fn|1}}, having dedicated themselves to the [[Chaos God]] [[Nurgle]].{{Fn|2}}

Paramyx now leads his [[Chaos Warband|Warband]] in spreading [[Nurgle]]'s plagues across numerous [[Imperial]] worlds, and his allied with the forces of the [[Fallen Angel]] [[Skethon]]{{Fn|3}}. The [[Blighted Claw]]s' rampage of infection, however, has made Paramyx a target of [[Kor'sarro Khan]], the [[White Scar]]'s [[Master of the Hunt]]. The Khan began a hunt for the [[Plague Lord]], which has led him across half a [[Segmentum]], but he vowed to claim the [[Paramyx]]'s head no matter how long it took. Their forces last encountered each other on the [[Agri World]] [[Gehöft]], which the Warband had infected with plagues. Even as the world rotted and the [[Plague Zombie|dead rose]] to fall upon the living, Kor'sarro Khan's Brotherood came to hunt down the Plague Lord. Among the other Imperial forces that came to Gehöft's aid were [[Dark Angels]]' [[Ravenwing]] and its [[Dark Angels Grand Master|Master]], [[Sammael]], agreed to aid the Khan in his hunt. While their [[Space Marine Company|Companies]] fought to defend the world, they each led a squadron to find Paramyx as the battle raged around them.{{Fn|2}} 

They succeeded in finding the [[Plague Lord]], but before the two reached him{{Fn|2}}, the [[Ravenwing]] spotted [[Skethon]]'s battle flag on a nearby war engine. This led [[Sammael]] to order his squadron to pursue the [[Fallen Angel]]'s war engine, but without the Ravenwing's aid, the Khan's squadron was overrun. Only the [[Master of the Hunt]] was able to escape{{Fn|3}} and Paramyx evaded his grasp once again{{Fn|2}}. Skethon also evaded the Ravenwing{{Fn|3}} and both escaped, to continue their attacks on other worlds{{Fn|2}}{{Fn|3}}. Their efforts had destroyed [[Gehöft]], however, and the [[Imperium]] launched an [[Exterminatus]] upon it shortly afterwards.{{Fn|2}}

