Paraon Uari.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Paraon Uari''' is a [[Primaris Librarian|Primaris]] [[Lexicanum]] in the [[Dark Krakens]] [[Chapter]]. He is currently among its forces in the [[Octarius Sector]], that [[Primaris Captain|Captain]] [[Krijeni Luceior]] is leading against [[Hive Fleet Leviathan]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
Newly ascended to the Chapter, he is nonetheless a powerful [[Psyker]] already tapped to one day become a commanding officer within the [[Librarius (Fortress-monastery)|Librarius]]. Skilled in the aquakinetic and sea creature-controlling art of ''wavecalling'', he has a deep affinity with wildlife of all kinds and does not take part in hunting expeditions like so many of his brothers. As such, he differentiates from the rest of his chapter in that he wears no fetishes or hunting trophies. Instead, he has painted a symbol of every beast he has ever psychically linked with upon his armour. He also has painted a skull seat in the gaping maws of a shark on each vembrance, representing a close Battle-Brother who was killed by him during his Librarius training. Uari was hideously disfigured in the same ritual, to the extend that he never takes off his helm.{{Fn|2}}

In battle, he wields the [[Force Sword]] [[Nightclaimer]] with great skill.{{Fn|2}}

