Parvan.wikitext:
{{ImperialKnightsPortal}}
'''Parvan''' is the [[High Monarch|Grand-Sire]] of the [[Imperial Knight]] [[Knight House|House]], [[House Hastine|Hastine]].{{Fn|1}}

In [[M42]], [[House Hastine]]'s [[Knight World]], [[Haenos]], became endangered, after its [[Imperial Knight]]s were drawn into a war with the [[T'au Empire]]. This occurred, when a battle between the [[Xenos]] and [[Adeptus Mechanicus]] on [[Fundas Reach]], grew to envelop the [[Sub-sector]] it shares with Haenos. As the war wore on, the T'au began secretly targeting the worlds of the Adeptus Mechanicus and Imperial Knights. Not with armed forces however, but instead with the Xenos' trade, diplomacy and technology. The invasive presence of the T'au on these worlds, was then later startlingly revealed to the [[Imperium]]. When Parvan was shown the corruption the T'au were having on Haenos, he recalled swathes of his [[Imperial Knight]]s to defend their [[Homeworld]]. Doing so though, reduced the House's chances of winning their war against emergent [[Necron]] [[Tomb World]] on the edges of the [[Eastern Fringe]].{{Fn|1}}

