Patrekr.wikitext:
{{SpaceWolvesPortal}}
'''Patrekr the Great Fanged''' was a [[Space Marine Dreadnought|Dreadnought]] in the [[Space Wolves]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
He was among its forces that took part in the [[Horus Heresy]]'s [[Burning of Prospero]], where they clashed with the [[Thousand Sons]]. During the battle, however, the [[Rune Priest]] [[Aun Helwintr]] sensed that terrible forces had been released in [[Prospero]]'s temple precinct and he sought to destroy it. He gathered Patrekr and the Dreadnought [[Cormek Dod]] to confront the threat, along with two dozen [[Silent Sisters]], who were led by [[Knight-Commander]] [[Jenetia Krole]]. The threat was soon revealed to be a [[Daemon]] shaped like the [[Warmaster]] [[Horus]], which had attacked and was about to kill the badly wounded Space Wolf [[Bjorn]] and the [[Skjald]] [[Kasper Ansbach Hawser]]. Helwintr and the Dreadnoughts attacked the Daemon before it could do so, but the Daemon survived and was unharmed. It was only when Krole and her Sisters of Silence arrived, that their attacks began to have an impact. Thanks to the Sisters' [[Null]] abilities, the Daemon was soon overwhelmed by the Dreadnoughts' attacks and it was finally destroyed.{{Fn|1}} 

==Sources==
