Peluros Mimon.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Peluros Mimon''' is an [[Astra Militarum]] [[General]], who serves in [[Indomitus Crusade Fleet Tertius]]' [[Battle Group Chion]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
He is the commander of Chion's '''Task Force II''', which is currently fighting a large force of [[Militarum Traitoris]] on an embattled world. However the [[Heretics]] have prevented the Task Force from directly attacking them, due to defending a vast range of foothills, with their heavy artillery and an apparent endless supply of munitions and troops. This, plus their territory being between the '''Dorus River''''s mile-wide raging torrent and the impassable '''Lemnian Mountains''', had kept the Task Force immovable for months. Finally though, Task Force II's [[Intelligor-Savant]]s identified the location of the Traitoris' high command in a base in the region and a plan was devised to kill them.{{Fn|1}} 

It was then decided that [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Quinto Gavian|Gavian]]'s [[Vanguard Infiltrator]] squadron would carry out the mission, while [[General]] Mimon distracted the heretics by leading the Task Force in an advance upon the Militarum Traitoris' base. There would be a time limit, however, before they were made to withdraw, as the attack would result in the deaths in many of the [[Astra Militarum]], [[Adeptus Sororitas]] and [[Aeronautica Imperialis]] Task Force members who would be charging the base. As the mission commenced, Gavian has neared the location of the heretics' high command and has vowed not to retreat until the mission is complete.{{Fn|1}}

