Perez Grist.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Perez Grist''' was a '''Data-Adjudicator''', amongst the [[Imperials]] that aided the [[Primarch]] [[Dorn]]'s efforts in planning the [[Imperial Palace]]'s defenses, during the [[Siege of Terra]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
When the [[Siege of Terra]] began, Grist was located in the [[Imperial Palace]]'s [[Bhab Bastion]] and worked within the Bastion's '''Grand Borealis Strategium''', which served as [[Dorn]]'s main control room. The Adjudicator and the other [[Imperial]]s were initially safe there, as the Bastion was located in the [[Inner Palace]] and was far from the fighting. Eventually though, despite Dorn's best efforts, the forces of the traitorous [[Warmaster]] [[Horus]] reached the Inner Palace and soon began attacking the Bhab Bastion's walls.{{Fn|1}} 

Despite this, the [[Imperial]]s there continued their work and did not stop, even as the [[Bhab Bastion]] was invaded. It was only as the [[Traitor]]s neared the '''Grand Borealis Strategium''', that it began to be evacuated for the safety of the [[Imperial Palace]]'s [[Sanctum Imperialis]]. However, this was done too late and Grist was among the many Imperials who were killed within the Strategium, before they could escape.{{Fn|1}}

