Pertinax (Chapter Master).wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinesPortal}}
'''Pertinax''' is the current [[Chapter Master]] of the [[Sons of Pertinax]], which due to its traditions changed its name to his when he ascended to the position.{{Fn|1}}


==History==
He succeeded [[Commodus (Chapter Master)|Commodus]], whose actions caused the Sons to be labelled as a [[Renegade Chapter]] in [[M41]]. This occurred after Commodus attempted to subjugate an entire world to his will, which drew the attention of the [[Inquisition]]. He was later declared a renegade for his actions and Commodus' reign was eventually ended by a [[Callidus Assassin]]. His heinous actions, though, tainted the Sons and after Pertinax took command, the [[Chapter]] began a [[Penitent Crusade]] in order to redeem themselves.{{Fn|1}}

==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
*The ''Sons of Pertinax'' and their history were created by [[Chris Birks]], when he served in [[Games Workshop]]'s official [[Outriders (Volunteer Program)|Outriders]] volunteer program. It was featured as an example [[Chapter]] for the UK [[White Dwarf]]'s '''Chapter Master Competition''' and was featured in [[White Dwarf 297 (UK)]].{{Fn|1}}
*''Pertinax'' is likely named for [[Wikipedia:Pertinax|the Roman Emperor Pertinax]], who succeeded [[Wikipedia:Commodus|Emperor Commodus]] after the latter's assassination in 192 AD.

