Petronella Vivar.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}

{{QuoteBox
|quote = '''''"It would take a thousand clichés to describe the Warmaster, each one truer than the last."'''''{{Fn|1b}}
|}}
{{QuoteBox
|quote = '''''"I was there the day that Horus fell."'''''{{Fn|1g}}
|}}

'''Petronella Vivar''', Palatina Majoria of [[House Carpinus]], was a [[remembrancer]] during the [[Great Crusade]] and in the early days of the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1a}}

==Biography==
Her family were well known for documenting the beginning of the [[Emperor]]'s [[unification]] of [[Terra]] and the quest to find the [[Primarch]]s, which gave her unusual prestige compared to other remembrancers: their wealth and social status as nobles ensure powerful connections, including the office of [[Malcador the Sigillite]].{{Fn|1c}}{{Fn|1d}}{{Fn|1e}}

Vivar arrived to the [[63rd Expeditionary Force]] later than the other remembrancers together with her personal bodyguard [[Maggard]]. Her goal was to become [[Warmaster]] [[Horus]]'s personal [[remembrancer]], a position which Horus was inclined to give her.{{Fn|1e}}

She followed the [[Imperial]] forces down to the [[Battle of Davin's Moon]], but her [[skiff]] was shot down by the [[Imperator Titan]] ''[[Dies Irae]]'' as it did not have a military transponder signal. Maggard and she were the only survivors, the bodyguard defending her against the [[Plague Zombies]] that had been coming out of the moon's mires, until the [[Luna Wolves]] rescued them.{{Fn|1f}} She similarly survived the battle around the crashed ship ''[[Glory of Terra]]'', and was by the Warmaster's side when the wound he sustained in his duel with [[Eugan Temba]] brought him down.{{Fn|1g}}

As Horus lay between life and death aboard the ''[[Vengeful Spirit]]'', he dictated his valediction to her, revealing his innermost secrets.{{Fn|1h}}

She was later killed by Horus himself aboard the ''Vengeful Spirit''.{{Fn|1i}} Whether this was to ensure that the secrets Horus revealed would remain so, or a reward for Maggard's service to him, is unclear.{{Fn|2}}

