Petronius Nero.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Petronius Nero''' is a [[Battle brother]] of the [[Ultramarines]] [[4th Company (Ultramarines)|4th Company]].  He currently serves as [[Company Champion]] in [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Uriel Ventris|Uriel Ventris's]] [[Space Marine Command Squad|Command Squad]], "[[The Swords of Calth]]."{{Fn|1a}}.

==History==
{{spoiler|source=The Chapter's Due (Novel)}}
An exceptional [[close combat]] specialist, Nero first distinguished himself during the [[Second Battle of Pavonis]], as part of a raiding party infiltrating the [[Tau]] internment camp.{{Fn|1a}}

As part of Uriel's Command Squad, Nero joined the defense of [[Calth]] from the invasion of the [[Bloodborn]] in late '''999.[[M41]]'''.  When the Captain tracked the [[Warsmith]] [[Honsou]] to the underground tomb of [[Remus Ventanus]], the Ultramarines were attacked by the [[Blade dancers]] of [[Xiomagra]].  The Mistress of the Blade dancers was far too fast for Uriel, but Nero stepped in and not only saved his life, but defeated Xiomagra with apparent ease.{{Fn|1b}}

Nero survived the collapse of the cavern engineered by Honsou, though he was grieved when his custom-made [[power sword]] was broken by the rockfall.{{Fn|1c}}

