{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Lord Phaedrus''' was [[Master of the Adeptus Astra Telepathica]] and a member of the [[High Lords of Terra]] in [[M36]] during the [[Age of Apostasy]].{{Fn|1}}

A powerful [[Psyker]], Phaedrus represented a threat to [[Goge Vandire]]'s ascension to absolute power within the [[Imperium]] as his formidable psychic abilities allowed him to be one step ahead of whatever schemes or machinations Vandire could come up with.  Eventually Vandire deployed [[Culexus]] assassins of the [[Officio Assassinorum]] to deal with Phaedrus.  The assassins drained Phaedrus of his psychic powers, stopping short of killing him in order to avoid another powerful psyker simply taking his place.  Robbed of his power, Phaedrus agreed to follow Goge Vandire on the condition that none would know of the loss of his psychic abilities, which led to Vandire's domination of the [[Adeptus Astra Telepathica]].{{Fn|1}}

