Phaendris.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Lord Phaendris the Unyielding Fire''' is one of the triplet [[Corsair Prince]]s that commands the [[Sunblitz Brotherhood]], which he shares with his brothers [[Siriolas]] and [[Erandael]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
The brothers are furiously loyal to each other and will not allow each other to be insulted by any outsiders. They are also quick to be offended by other [[Corsairs]]; in particular they hold a long-running resentment for the [[Void Dragons]]. Despite their fierce bond, however, the triplets rarely fight together, as their brotherly rivalry leads them to frequently anger each other. Instead each brother leads their own forces against the lesser [[Xenos]] species which they have such contempt for. Each [[Corsair Prince]], though, has a particular species they target, as it has earned their deepest hatred. It is [[Mankind]] for Phaendris, as he feels the species is fated to repeat the same ancient mistakes that [[Fall of the Eldar|doomed]] the [[Aeldari]].{{Fn|1}}

Within the [[Choraplex]], Phaendris has claimed the orbital station [[XY-352]] and everything in it. To that end he infiltrated the station with kill-teams before launching a larger invasion.{{Fn|2}}

