Phasmos Yrech.wikitext:
{{ThousandSonsPortal}}
[[file:Yrech.jpg|thumb|right|200px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|1}}]]
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Sorcerer]] of the [[Thousand Sons]] [[Cult of Knowledge]].{{Fn|1}}

Known to sacrifice, abandon, and betray a great many of his followers, Phasmos Yrech has cast his underlings to the winds of war each time his schemes have required a sacrifice. A singularly selfish creature whose only true allegiance is to [[Tzeentch]], he has progressed through the ranks of more than half the Cults of the Thousand Sons ([[Cult of Magic|Magic]], [[Cult of Time|Time]], [[Cult of Scheming|Scheming]], [[Cult of Mutation|Mutation]], and now Knowledge). During the [[Siege of Corefall]], [[Amaat the Scarlet]] mocked Yrech, claiming he would never master Tzeentch's greater mysteries.  Yet in the sorcerous duel that followed, it was Yrech who was victorious.{{Fn|1}}
With his ever-shifting loyalties, he has accumulated new treasures and powerful artifacts as well as fresh tracts of lore he keeps in an every growing library of grimoires. His followers have grown as well, drawn in by his charisma and added to his ever-changing ranks.{{Fn|1}}

