Phetturclak.wikitext:
{{AdeptusMechanicusPortal}}
'''Phetturclak''' is an [[Adeptus Mechanicus]] [[Magos|Magos-Abjuratis]], who is serving in the [[Indomitus Crusade]]'s [[Battle Group Faustus (Fleet Secundus)|Battle Group Faustus]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
The [[Battle Group Faustus (Fleet Secundus)|Battle Group]] is currently taking part in the [[Thranx Purge]], against the forces of [[Chaos]], within the [[Bosphori System]]. During the campaign, the Battle Group was made aware of a dire Chaos threat, that the [[Rogue Psyker]] [[Darian Pellor]] had awakened. After hearing this, '''Task Force Faustus IV''' was formed, in order to deal with Pellor. Dhaur-Carriadh agreed and Justyne is now commanding the Task Force against the Rogue Psyker. Phetturclak is part of the Task Force and is leading 3 [[Adeptus Mechanicus]] [[Combat Servitor|servitor combat maniples]] within it.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
