Phillips.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Phillips''' was an [[Imperial Guard]] commander and [[Lord Commander Solar]] during the early part of [[M41]].{{Fn|1}}

He was captured during the [[Roxane Rebellion]] by rebel forces, only to be rescued by the [[Macharia|Donian]] [[General]] [[Macharius (Character)|Macharius]]. After the battle and Macharius's victory over the rebels, Phillips made Macharius his successor as Lord Commander Solar. Phillips would later die during the [[Lemort Landings]].{{Fn|1}}

