'''Pious Korren''' is a [[Major]] of the [[Armageddon Steel Legion]] [[Imperial Guard]].  He is renowned as one of the greatest tank aces in the Steel Legion's history, earning his title in the [[Third War for Armageddon]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
Pious Korren was born into a family which traditionally served in the [[Imperial Navy]], and the young Pious reluctantly joined the navy, never fitting in, showing little interest in his job, and frequently getting into disciplinary problems.  He was dismissed by the [[Fleet Commissariat]] shortly before [[Ghazghkull Mag Uruk Thraka]] launched his [[Third War for Armageddon|second invasion of Armageddon]].  The young Pious, stranded on his homeworld, found himself stranded at [[Hive Volcanus]].  Pious signed up for the nearest [[PDF]] militia unit and proved an exemplary officer cadet in the ground forces, quickly making [[2nd Lieutenant]] and assigned command of a [[Leman Russ Battle Tank]] squadron.  Towards the later stages of the war, Pious was one of the highest-rated tank aces of the entire Steel Legion, having scored hundreds of [[Ork]] vehicle kills, including three [[Stompa]]s.{{Fn|1}}

==The Iron Saint==
Pious's most famed vehicle is a [[Shadowsword]] known as the ''[[Iron Saint]]''. Over the course of the war, the crew of the ''Iron Saint'' went from an inexperienced rabble to a group of skilled veterans.  The ''Iron Saint'' gained its greatest fame during the [[Battle of Anthrand Plain]], where Pious and his crew single-handedly destroyed an enormous number of Ork vehicles over the course of a single night.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
