Pollo.wikitext:
{{TanithPortal}}
'''Pollo''' was a [[Trooper]] of the [[Tanith First and Only]].{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
Pollo was originally a [[Imperial citizen|citizen]] of [[Vervunhive]] on the planet [[Verghast]]. He was employed as a bodyguard by the [[Noble House]] [[House Anko|Anko]].{{Fn|1}}

Following the [[Siege of Vervunhive]], Pollo signed up for the [[Astra Militarum]] and was drafted into the [[Tanith First and Only]], one of the [[Imperial Guard Regiment]]s fighting in the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}

==Wargear==
Due to the fact that he was charged with protecting a wealthy nobleman from one of the planet's most powerful Houses, Pollo was surgically enhanced by his patrons. He was fitted with neural implants that significantly improved his reaction speed over a baseline [[human]].{{Fn|1}}

In addition, Pollo was amongst those guardsmen in the Tanith First who held onto and maintained a personal weapon to augment their standard-issue arsenal; in his case, he carried an [[autopistol]].{{Fn|1}}

