Polonius.wikitext:
{{ImperialKnightsPortal}}
'''Polonius''' is a [[Baron]] of [[House Terryn]], who took part in the [[Argovon Campaign]] as part of the [[Indomitus Crusade]]'s [[Task Force XI]].{{Fn|1}} 

As the war against the [[Necron]]s raged, Polonius served in the Task Force's senior command staff as a representative of the [[Imperial Knights]]. He was joined by Baroness [[Rozalind]] and Baroness [[Maryanna]], after all three refused to agree to which single Knight would represent them in the Task Force.{{Fn|1}}

==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
