Potaex Hitsen.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Potaex Hitsen''' is a [[Psychic]] [[Rogue Trader]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He is a rarity among his profession, as Hitsen is bored of being a [[Rogue Trader]]. So much so, that any diversion, no matter how trivial, will absorb him totally - or at least until the diversion becomes boring! Hitsen's original contingent of troops, for example, were jettisoned into space when the Rogue Trader became bored with their [[regiment]]ed uniformity. His nature has also led Hitsen into intensive studies of the worlds and civilizations he encounters. Some he [[Dead World|destroys]] in passing afterwards, but for most the Rogue Trader will devise some highly unorthodox scheme for their development or integration into the [[Imperium]]. Hitsen also likes to recruit his forces from the worlds he encounters, which makes his troops an exotically varied, and at times not-too-boring, bunch.{{Fn|1}}

