The process involves the subjects being questioned, while they are tortured by the [[Ecclesiarchy]]'s ruthless [[Excrutiator]]s. Those who are successful are declared Living Saints, while those who fail are immediately executed. In the course of the [[Imperium]]'s history, there have been many who have claimed to be Living Saints. However most were undone by the Probos Malefica and instead been revealed as agents of the [[Chaos Gods]]. These false gods take pleasure in using the Imperium's [[Imperial Cult|faith]] against itself and conjuring false hope in the hearts of Imperials. This why those who claim to be Living Saints are treated with extreme caution, until they successfully pass the Ecclesiarchy's testing.{{Fn|1}}

