{{Spoiler|source=Ahriman: Eternal (Novel)}}
His power and learning had always been great and had earned Ptollen a place in the outer circles of [[Ahriman]]'s original cabal. He would later joined Ahriman's [[Exiles]] and of the [[Chaos Warband|Warband]]'s members, Ptollen most favored the martial over the cerebral. He focused his psychic powers on war and used them in his physical attacks to kill his foes.{{Fn|1}}  

Ptollen took part in the [[Exiles]] creation of the [[Second Rubric of Ahriman]] ritual they cast on the [[Sortiarius]], before they made their escape. However the ritual did not end as they suspected and is now raging out of control. This led to the creation of the [[Pyrodomon]] blast wave of fire, which began to appear out of the [[Warp]] to repeatedly strike the [[Chaos Warband|Warband]]. The Exiles did not know how to stop it, but began searching for a cure after one attack turned the [[Sorcerer]] [[Iskiades]] into a [[Rubric Marine]]. However they were not able to find one, before Ptollen was turned into a Rubric Marine as well.{{Fn|1}}

