{{NecronPortal}}
'''Qemau''' was a [[Necron Overlord]] of the [[Szarekhan Dynasty]], who was among its forces that watched over [[Vertigus II]] after the world fell to the [[Xenos]].{{Fn|1a}}  

He protected the [[Khalaian Gate]] spaceport on the conquered [[Imperial]] world, when the forces of  the [[Ultramarines]] later invaded. A small force of the [[Space Marines]] then entered the spaceport, in order to gain access to its [[Astropathic Station|Astropathic Relay Station]] and learn how [[Vertigus II]] had fallen to the [[Necrons]]. Qemau lay in wait for them, with his forces, alongside the insubordinate [[Skorpekh Lord]] [[Tynakht]], whose aid the [[Necron Overlord|Overlord]] grudgingly accepted due to the Destroyer's skills as a killer{{Fn|1a}}. The Necron attacked, when the Ultramarines neared the Relay Station and in the battle that followed, Qemau was able to kill the leader of the Space Marines. The Overlord later died at the hands of an [[Assault Intercessor]] [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]], but his surviving forces were able to defeat the Ultramarines.{{Fn|1b}}

