'''Quercus''' is a [[Tech Priest]]{{Fn|1}}, who is currently serving under [[Magos]] [[Herrode]], alongside his twin brother and fellow Tech Priest, [[Quintus (Tech Priest)|Quintus]].{{Fn|2}}
==History==
It is said that he and his brother are over 500 years old, but both are still as strong as ancient [[Terran]] [[Oak]]s{{Fn|1}}. They are currently aiding [[Magos]] [[Herrode]] in his efforts to search for lost [[archeotech]] from the remains of [[Cephiivytra]]'s{{Fn|2}} [[Hive Cities]], in the wake of the world being reclaimed by the [[Imperium]]. Each brother has command of menial tech-scavenger warriors to aid them, but though Cephiivytra is back in the Imperium's control, it is still dangerous. The Magos' forces have had to defend themselves from hostile forces within the Hive Cities, which has included a [[daemonic]] presence that is lurking on Cephiivytra.{{Fn|1}}
