Quintis (Tactical Marine).wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Quintis''' is a [[Tactical Marine]] in the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter]] squadron of [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Galonis]].{{Fn|1a}}
==History==
He was among its forces{{Fn|1a}} that took part in the [[First Tyrannic War]]'s [[Battle for Macragge]], where the [[Ultramarines]] defended their [[Adeptus Astartes Homeworld|Homeworld]] from [[Hive Fleet Behemoth]].{{Fn|1}} As the battle raged, [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Galonis]]' squadron was sent to recover an armored [[cogitator]] from the wreckage of the crashed [[Imperial Lander]] [[Steadfast]]. It was brought down by Behemoth's vanguard fleet and the Ultramarines sought the vital information that the Steadfast's cogitator recorded, during the Lander's journey. The crash site was in one of [[Macragge]]'s most inhospitable regions, but when the Galonis squadron arrived there, they were attacked by [[Tyranids]]. The Sergeant then split the squadron into two in order to combat the Xenos. While Galonis led one half of the squadron, the other was commanded by Quintis. However it is not known if the squadron succeeded in their mission.{{Fn|1a}}

