In [[M42]], he was among the renowned warriors that the [[Necron Overlord]] [[Trazyn the Infinite]] kidnapped and placed in an arena within the Overlord's hidden '''Sanctum''', which is connected to the [[Tomb World]] [[Solemnace]], via [[Reality-Tether]]s. The [[Terminator]] then found himself facing the [[Death Guard]] [[Refulgus Grue]], the [[Ultramarine]] [[Markus Castus]] and the [[Necron]] [[Teknoth]]. They were all brought there to fight for Trazyn's enjoyment, but the Overlord promised the victor would be freed from their imprisonment{{Fn|1a}}. Though he is furious about his imprisonment, Rafelo knows he is now losing himself to the [[Blood Angels]]' [[Gene-seed]] curse, known as the [[Red Thirst]]. This however has made the Terminator determined to defeat any foe or obstacle that stands in his way{{Fn|1b}}. Though unbeknownst to Rafelo and the other warriors, the Overlord has no intention of freeing the arena winner. Instead the victor will have the honor of taking a place of pride within Trazyn's latest exhibit on Solemnace.{{Fn|1a}}   
