Rakk Golloth.wikitext:
{{IronHandsPortal}}
[[Image:Golloth.jpg|thumb|right|220px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|2}}]]
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was the [[Iron Captain]] of [[Clan Sorrgol]] of the [[Iron Hands]] as of 997.[[M41]].{{Fn|1}}

Following the birth of the [[Great Rift]], Golloth led the Clan in an aggressive campaign to ensure the tributary worlds of the Iron Hands did not fall into anarchy. Ultimately, not all such worlds were chosen worthy of preservation. Loath to cede resources to the enemy, Golloth subjected these abandoned worlds to [[Exterminatus]]. Robbed of war material, the [[Chaos]] onslaught stalled and Golloth was granted the opportunity to bring stability to the valuable manufactorums of [[Kholan]].{{Fn|2}}

While the [[Iron Council]] acclaims Golloth's decisiveness during the campaign, he himself was slain during the [[Liberation of Odissar]] when his gunship was shot down by traitor anti-aircraft fire. Golloth's last order was that [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]] [[Kaldabane Vhor]] take command and waste no resource recovering his body.{{Fn|2}}

