Ralshap.wikitext:
{{ImperialNavyPortal}}
'''Ralshap''' is a [[Lord Commander of the Imperial Navy]], who had served in the [[Eastern Fringes]] for sixty years, when the [[Second Tyrannic War]] began.{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was part of the [[Imperium]]'s initial defense against [[Hive Fleet Kraken]], but faced his worst nightmare, as the [[Tyranids]]' tendrils spread throughout the [[Eastern Fringes]]. As [[System]]s began to be lost, Ralshap also had to contend with the tens of thousands of refuges that fled them seeking safety. Though the [[Lord Commander of the Imperial Navy|Lord Commander]] knew the Imperium's forces were being moblized and the [[High Lords of Terra]] were aware of the threat, it would be a year perhaps before a proper response arrived. Until then, Ralshap realized he would need to deploy every force, weapon and warship that was at hand, in order to keep the Tyranids at bay.{{Fn|1}}
==Trivia==
''Ralshap'' was created by the [[Games Workshop]] employee [[Warwick Kinrade]] and he appeared in [[Firepower Issue 4]].{{Fn|1}}

