Ramos.wikitext:
{{EmperorsChildrenPortal}}
'''Ramos''', known as the '''Bull of the Eighth''', is a [[Noise Marine]] champion of the [[Emperor's Children]].{{Fn|1a}}

Ramos was part of the Emperor's Children 8th Company during the [[Horus Heresy]], where he infamously cracked the Medean Gate on [[Luna]] during the [[Solar War]]. He later joined the [[12th Millennial]] under [[Kasperos Telmar]] and led the warband's [[Noise Marine]] force.{{Fn|1a}} During [[The Shattering]], Ramos and his Noise Marines combined their song to devastate the [[Eldar]] of [[Craftworld]] [[Lugganath]]. After the battle and the scattering of the 12th Millennial, Ramos and his surviving Noise Marines joined the forces of [[Fabius Bile]].{{Fn|1b}}

Ramos and his Noise Marines next accompanied Fabius to [[Solemnace]] alongside the clone of [[Fulgrim]], where they held off a force of [[Harlequin]]s aboard the ''[[Vesalius]]'' with the help of [[Daemonette]]s.{{Fn|2}} Still in Fabius' service, his forces made their final stand during the [[Battle of Belial IV]], holding a [[Webway Gate]] against [[Dark Eldar]] forces and allowing time for the rest of the [[Consortium]] forces to flee.{{Fn|3}}

Despite his reputation and terrifying size, Ramos was a wise and stoic individual and felt the song of [[Slaanesh]] in all things.{{Fn|1a}}

