'''Rapal Staccata''' is an [[Interrogator]] for the [[Ordo Xenos]] [[Lord Inquisitor]], [[Varrigan]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
In [[M42]], the [[Inquisitor Lord]] was part of an [[Inquisition|Inquisitorial Tribunal]] that was charged with determining if the execution of the [[Radical]] [[Helynna Valeria]] was [[Excommunicate Traitoris|just]]. Along with his two fellow [[Inquisitor]]s, [[Cataclis]] and [[Derval Bossch]], they brought Valeria's executioner, [[Katarinya Greyfax]], before them to explain her reasons for killing the Radical Inquisitor. Though the Tribunal was hidden from the [[Puritan]]'s eyes, such an investigation usually had its three members represent one of [[Ordo Hereticus|the]] [[Ordo Malleus|three]] [[Ordo Xenos|major]] Ordos. Because of this, Greyfax was able to correctly guess the Tribunal's identities, due to various observations she had made. She correctly deducted Varrigan was there first, due to the fact that Staccata served him and the [[Interrogator]] was conducting Greyfax's interview, on the Tribunal's behalf.{{Fn|1}}  

