Rarthanis.wikitext:
{{ImperialKnightsPortal}}
[[Image:Rarthanis.jpg|thumb|right|300px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|2}}]]
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an [[Imperial Knight]] of [[House Griffith]] who pilots the Knight suit known as '''Dragon's Lament'''.{{Fn|1}} 

When the [[Rogue Trader]] [[Dragalos]] secured House Griffith's aid for his journey to the world [[Posidac IV]], {{PAGENAME}} was sent to protect the Rogue Trader's expedition as it explored the world's oceans. This would prove to be fortunate, after Dragalos's submersible vessel discovered a sunken city there and the Rogue Trader's vessel and {{PAGENAME}} were suddenly attacked by ancient [[Men of Iron|metallic automata]] who dwelled within it. The automata had been trapped in the city, by the world's original population, since the [[Age of Strife]] and wished to use Dragalos's vessel to escape, but luckily {{PAGENAME}} was able to destroy them all, despite being heavily outnumbered. Due to {{PAGENAME}}'s efforts, Dragalos was able to fully explore the sunken city and returned to the [[Imperium]] with his holds heavy with ancient technology.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Imperial Knight Companion]], pg. 49
*{{Endn|2}}: [[Codex: Imperial Knights (10th Edition)]], pg. 33

