Rask (General).wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Rask''' was an [[Astra Militarum]] [[General]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
He was among the [[Imperial]] forces that defended the [[Margus System]], during the [[Octarius War|invasion]] of the [[Pankallis Sub-sector]]. At that time, the System came under attack by [[Hive Fleet Leviathan]] and began to be overrun. When it became obvious Margus' worlds were lost, though, an evacuation from the [[System]] began. [[Planetary Governor|Governor]] [[Zarkanay]] hoped to have the [[General]]s Rask, [[Healen]], [[Bartius]] and [[Reng]] evacuated, along with their armies, in order to reinforce her world. However of the few hundred thousand that were able to flee the Margus System, none of the Generals or their armies escaped.{{Fn|1}}

==Source==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[War Zone Octarius - Book 2: Critical Mass]], pg. 18 - ''Classified Document: Echoes of Octarius''

