Rasputin.wikitext:
{{InquisitionPortal}}
'''Rasputin''' was an [[Inquisitor]].{{Fn|1}}

While observing the [[Ravenwing]] and [[Deathwing]] work in conjunction to capture a prisoner, Inquisitor Rasputin believed he had, at last, solved the riddle of the [[Dark Angels]].  As he turned to leave the battlefield, only his lightning-fast reflexes and a nigh-impenetrable force field allowed him to survive a flurry of shots that would have slain him.  Even as a [[Cypher|hooded figure]] advanced upon his position, a new conflict broke out.  Ravenwing troops on bikes had picked up Cypher’s trail and pursued him as he attempted to gun down the Inquisitor before escaping.  Rasputin never made his final report.{{Fn|1}}

==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
*Rasputin may be named after Russian mystic [[wikipedia:Grigori Rasputin|Grigori Rasputin]].

